sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant P as Purchases UI
  participant DB as Postgres
  participant T as Triggers
  participant F as Finance UI
  U->>P: Create purchase ₹3000 (Ordered)
  P->>DB: INSERT purchases, purchase_items
  U->>P: Mark Received
  T-->>DB: set_purchase_delivery_date
  T-->>DB: handle_purchase_inventory_update (qty ↑)
  U->>P: Mark Paid
  T-->>DB: sync_purchase_to_expense → INSERT expenses
  F->>DB: SELECT expenses WHERE expense_date in period
  DB-->>F: Expense KPI ↑ ₹3000
  Note over F: FY Profit only after recompute_fy_actuals
